                            </picture>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="why-content">
                        <h2>Why Choose Lexino AI?</h2>
                        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; opacity: 0.95;">
                            Lexino AI is designed to feel fast, personal, and dependable. It helps you study smarter, build faster, write better, and innovate with confidence.
                        </p>
                        <ul class="why-list">
                            <li>⚡ <strong>Lightning Fast:</strong> Process requests and stream responses token-by-token in milliseconds.</li>
                            <li>🎓 <strong>Smarter Study & Exam Prep:</strong> Concept breakdowns, revision guides, and mock practice for UPSC, JEE, NEET, & GATE.</li>
                            <li>💻 <strong>Coding & Technical Interviews:</strong> Debug, understand concepts, and practice DSA challenges with instant feedback.</li>
                            <li>🔒 <strong>Privacy-First Architecture:</strong> Your data stays private, encrypted, and protected by default.</li>
                            <li>🎨 <strong>Personalized Spaces & 3D Wallpapers:</strong> Transform your UI into custom cosmic themes that inspire creative flow.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>
            <!-- Technology Section -->
            <section class="section" id="technology">
                <h2>Powered by Intelligence. Protected by Trust.</h2>
                <p style="text-align: center; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; font-size: 1.2rem; line-height: 1.8; opacity: 0.9;">
                   Lexino’s hybrid AI core combines advanced neural intelligence with real-world understanding to deliver fast, contextual, and reliable assistance. From reasoning and research to everyday productivity, Lexino is designed to understand not just what you ask — but why you ask it.<br><br>
                   <strong>Intelligent by Design • Private by Default • Built for You</strong>
                </p>
            </section>
